  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v5.2.0 - Stalled drain made visible (#71): audit_spool_oldest_age_seconds gauge, opt-in health signal (EncryptedSpoolOptions.OldestRecordMaxAge, OldestRecordStatus), a reason tag on audit_spool_dead_lettered_total, and the documented answer for an unknown key (503 while keys load, 422 when gone). See CHANGELOG.md. v5.1.0 - Encrypted spool throughput (#69): opt-in batched delivery (EncryptedSpoolOptions.DeliveryBatchSize, POST {EndpointBaseUrl}/audit/batch; default 1 keeps the wire unchanged); concurrent durable writes no longer queue behind one gate, the cap still holds; a full spool refuses from its tally and re-checks the disk at most once per SpoolFullRecheckInterval instead of scanning the directory on every write; dropped records are logged at Critical at a bounded rate. See CHANGELOG.md.",
